.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-config\-inspect\-policy \- Inspect the cryptographic policy
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq config inspect policy\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]  
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Inspect the cryptographic policy.
.PP
Explains the cryptographic policy that Sequoia uses to either accept or reject algorithms and packets outright, or at a configured point in time.
.PP


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
Inspect the cryptographic policy.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq config inspect policy
.RE
.fi
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1), \fBsq\-config\fR(1), \fBsq\-config\-inspect\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
